{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/eae252b2eea1c0fbdb5b79ee90daaf88.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This demo is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to Found Sheep Farm to find belonging, to build community, and to reconnect with your friend Sonia, whom you haven\u2019t seen in years. However, when you arrive, Sonia is nowhere to be seen: instead, you\u2019re greeted by four cute and charming farmers and their retreat director, Mr. Sheppard, who all deny Sonia ever existed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, well! Now you have the summer to bond with your fellow farmers, complete daily chores with the help of your new friends, explore the charming grounds of the farm, and\u2026 wait. What was that in the woods?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This \u201cdating sim\u201d psychological horror title gives you the choice: Will you pull the wool over your eyes to find true happiness, or will your pursuit of the truth make you the black sheep?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first week of the novel which includes 1-2 hours of reading, minigames, and point &amp; click exploration. Chore selection is limited to only Miriam during the demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/017c4720ed11dc66d6d1a053a768cc9c.poster.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/017c4720ed11dc66d6d1a053a768cc9c.webm?t=1757565977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Point &amp; Click Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/08b1cccee101deadc4894bb3add41a1d.poster.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/08b1cccee101deadc4894bb3add41a1d.webm?t=1757565977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006800?t=1757565977","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006800?t=1757565977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/33a02e22dd0a2eab312b3afd5a89bc08edf4d00e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757565977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/33a02e22dd0a2eab312b3afd5a89bc08edf4d00e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757565977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence, horror, blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/eae252b2eea1c0fbdb5b79ee90daaf88.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This demo is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to Found Sheep Farm to find belonging, to build community, and to reconnect with your friend Sonia, whom you haven\u2019t seen in years. However, when you arrive, Sonia is nowhere to be seen: instead, you\u2019re greeted by four cute and charming farmers and their retreat director, Mr. Sheppard, who all deny Sonia ever existed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, well! Now you have the summer to bond with your fellow farmers, complete daily chores with the help of your new friends, explore the charming grounds of the farm, and\u2026 wait. What was that in the woods?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This \u201cdating sim\u201d psychological horror title gives you the choice: Will you pull the wool over your eyes to find true happiness, or will your pursuit of the truth make you the black sheep?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first week of the novel which includes 1-2 hours of reading, minigames, and point &amp; click exploration. Chore selection is limited to only Miriam during the demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/017c4720ed11dc66d6d1a053a768cc9c.poster.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/017c4720ed11dc66d6d1a053a768cc9c.webm?t=1757565977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Point &amp; Click Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/08b1cccee101deadc4894bb3add41a1d.poster.avif?t=1757565977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006800/extras/08b1cccee101deadc4894bb3add41a1d.webm?t=175